// Placeholder for the generated MCP tool list. Building the documentation
// generates the list from a Qt Creator build into the build directory (the
// regenerate_mcp_tools_doc target), where it takes precedence over this file.

//! [tools]
This version of the documentation does not include the tool list. To see the
tools that your \QC offers, along with their descriptions and parameters, ask
your MCP client to list the tools of the \QC MCP server.
//! [tools]
